=== KEY FINDINGS FOR NARRATIVE ===
ENROLMENT (girls 15-24, with wealth, province FE):
  Dalit: -5.4 pp | Disability: -20.9 pp

NEET (youth 15-24, with wealth, province FE):
  Female: +6.9 pp | Dalit: +0.6 pp | Poor: +0.4 pp | Disability: +24.1 pp

Without wealth controls:
  Dalit enrolment penalty: -6.8 pp (was -5.4 pp with wealth)
  Dalit NEET premium: +1.9 pp (was +0.6 pp with wealth)
  => If Dalit penalty INCREASES without wealth, wealth was masking/absorbing caste effect
  => If unchanged, caste penalty is truly independent of wealth

